      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        351.4517822265625,
        21.884788513183594,
        407.7772216796875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "programmes on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        407.7772216796875,
        21.884788513183594,
        518.984130859375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "the management of tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        518.984130859375,
        21.884788513183594,
        557.1551513671875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        80.14361572265625,
        99.70339965820312,
        109.03961181640625
      ],
      "text": "E",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 24.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        100.06320190429688,
        87.01241302490234,
        287.6162109375,
        107.23960876464844
      ],
      "text": "xecutive summary",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Black-SC70",
      "size": 16.799999237060547,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        137.9017333984375,
        513.4605102539062,
        151.25323486328125
      ],
      "text": "Important recent changes or additions to guidelines for the management of tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        153.82925415039062,
        513.426025390625,
        167.249755859375
      ],
      "text": "Guidance for national  (TB) in children have made it necessary to revise the first edition of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        169.82577514648438,
        513.4606323242188,
        183.24627685546875
      ],
      "text": "tuberculosis programmes on the management of tuberculosis in children , published by",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        185.89129638671875,
        159.17990112304688,
        199.2427978515625
      ],
      "text": "WHO in 2006.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        213.226806640625,
        513.4605712890625,
        226.57830810546875
      ],
      "text": "Like the 2006 guidance, this document is targeted at national TB programmes,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        229.22332763671875,
        513.4490356445312,
        242.5748291015625
      ],
      "text": "paediatricians and other health workers in low- and middle-income countries; it does",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        245.2198486328125,
        513.4144287109375,
        258.57135009765625
      ],
      "text": "not aim to outline recommendations for high-income countries with low TB prevalence.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        261.21636962890625,
        513.4834594726562,
        274.56787109375
      ],
      "text": "This distinction is especially important in the diagnostic approach and in contact",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        277.212890625,
        153.4069061279297,
        290.56439208984375
      ],
      "text": "investigation.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        304.54840087890625,
        513.3916015625,
        317.89990234375
      ],
      "text": "Current and consistent guidance is important in the development and implementation",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        320.5448913574219,
        513.3799438476562,
        333.8963928222656
      ],
      "text": "of policy and practice for improving the management of children with TB and of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        336.5413818359375,
        513.41455078125,
        349.89288330078125
      ],
      "text": "children living in families with TB. Children are increasingly recognized as important in",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        352.5378723144531,
        513.3801879882812,
        365.8893737792969
      ],
      "text": "the widening global Stop TB Strategy, launched in 2006, revised in 2012 and now being",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        368.53436279296875,
        207.5373992919922,
        381.8858642578125
      ],
      "text": "revised for beyond 2015.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        395.869873046875,
        513.4605102539062,
        409.22137451171875
      ],
      "text": "This summary lists the recommendations of the second edition of the guidance and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        411.8663635253906,
        513.4144897460938,
        425.2178649902344
      ],
      "text": "highlights the key changes since the 2006 (first) edition (labelled as “new” in the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        427.86285400390625,
        513.4605102539062,
        441.21435546875
      ],
      "text": "summary of recommendations below). The chapters that follow the summary provide",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        443.8593444824219,
        513.4146118164062,
        457.2108459472656
      ],
      "text": "comprehensive details on the WHO-recommended approaches to prevention, diagnosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        459.8558349609375,
        158.30589294433594,
        473.20733642578125
      ],
      "text": "and treatment.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        487.19134521484375,
        513.4603881835938,
        500.5428466796875
      ],
      "text": "Updated literature searches were performed and new data were integrated with the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        503.18780517578125,
        513.3800048828125,
        516.539306640625
      ],
      "text": "existing evidence for all recommendations. During the development of this guidance,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        519.184326171875,
        513.4718627929688,
        532.5358276367188
      ],
      "text": "the Panel made strong recommendations, based on low or very low quality of evidence",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        535.1808471679688,
        513.4606323242188,
        548.5323486328125
      ],
      "text": "given that children are rarely included in TB clinical trials and experience disproportionate",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        551.1773071289062,
        513.46044921875,
        564.52880859375
      ],
      "text": "suffering as a result of limited detection and treatment. Despite the limited evidence",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        567.1737670898438,
        513.3915405273438,
        580.5252685546875
      ],
      "text": "showing a direct benefit to children, the Panel felt confident that existing clinical",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        583.1702880859375,
        513.3684692382812,
        596.5217895507812
      ],
      "text": "data from adults could be safely extrapolated to children, and that the individual and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        599.1668090820312,
        513.4144897460938,
        612.518310546875
      ],
      "text": "public health benefit of treating children with TB far outweigh any potential negative",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        615.163330078125,
        513.4375610351562,
        628.5148315429688
      ],
      "text": "consequences. Panel considerations and decisions for each individual recommendation",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        631.1598510742188,
        207.53741455078125,
        644.5113525390625
      ],
      "text": "are included in Annex 1.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        564.2039184570312,
        805.8439331054688,
        575.3239135742188,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "1",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}